    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929",
        "text": "=# Draft Answer for PSNM Question\n\nThe prospect has asked a question about PSNM services. Draft a helpful reply:\n\n**Original Email:**\nFrom: {{ $('Extract Reply Data').item.json.email_from }}\nSubject: {{ $('Extract Reply Data').item.json.email_subject }}\nBody: {{ $('Extract Reply Data').item.json.email_body }}\n\n**PSNM Context:**\n- Location: Barnsley, South Yorkshire S70 (10 mins from M1 J36/37)\n- Capacity: 4000+ pallet spaces, secure warehouse\n- Services: storage, picking, packing, dispatch coordination, inventory management\n- Access: 24/7 customer access available\n- Equipment: forklifts, pallet wrapping, loading bays\n- Rates: Competitive (£X/pallet/week - check Supabase config)\n- Contact: Ben Greenwood, 07506 255033, palletstoragenearme@gmail.com\n\n**Tone:**\n- Professional but direct (Ben's voice)\n- Answer their question fully\n- Offer a call if the answer is complex\n- End with clear next step\n\n**Output:** Plain text email body only, no JSON.",
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": 1024,
          "temperature": 0.7
        }
      },
